Slice 049, `tln x` online (entry `commands`). One home with the compiler `nightly-2026-10-14-38a3029` installed (the pin of each app), `TALON_NOW=2026-10-15T12:00:00Z`, no `config.toml` (`min-release-age` is 2 days), no tty. The fake `roc build` writes the output file. The fake `exec!` runs nothing: the rules of `fx/exec` give the exit code of the app.
acme/foo has 2 releases (1.1.0, 1.0.0), acme/bar has 1.1.0 and 1.0.0 (an `x` entry of 1.0.0 is in the cache), acme/baz has 1.0.0 (installed, and an `x` entry of the same version is in the cache), acme/old has 1.0.0 (an `x` entry of 0.9.0 is in the cache).
